  <h1>Constitution 模板</h1>
  <div class="meta-line"><span class="tag">模板</span> 直接复制使用</div>

  <h2 id="usage">使用说明</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>放在项目根目录的 <code>.specify/constitution.md</code> 或 <code>docs/constitution.md</code></li>
    <li>每次 AI 会话开始时前置注入（system prompt 中引用）</li>
    <li>每次迭代 review Constitution 的执行效果，持续增删改</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="template">模板</h2>
<pre><code># Project Constitution

> 项目不可变规则。每条规则配 3 件事：人读说明 + AI 提示片段 + 自动校验。
> 三件事缺一不算落地。

---

## 架构约束

### ARCH-001：模块依赖方向
**人读说明**：业务模块可以依赖公共模块，公共模块不能反向依赖业务模块。
不允许循环依赖。

**AI 提示片段**：
NEVER create circular dependencies between modules.
Shared/common modules (.common, .shared, .util) MUST NOT import from domain modules.
If you need shared logic, extract it into the common module first.

**自动校验**：ArchUnit test: verify no cycles between packages.
CI check: ArchUnit rules must pass before merge.

---

### ARCH-002：API 版本策略
**人读说明**：所有对外 API 必须带版本前缀 /api/v1/。
Breaking changes 需要新版本号。

**AI 提示片段**：
All API routes MUST start with /api/v1/.
If making a breaking change, create a new version (/api/v2/) and deprecate the old one.

**自动校验**：CI check: grep for route definitions without /api/vN/ prefix → BLOCK.

---

## 安全基线

### SEC-001：SQL 注入防护
**人读说明**：绝对不允许字符串拼接 SQL。
必须使用参数化查询或 ORM。

**AI 提示片段**：
CRITICAL: NEVER concatenate user input into SQL strings.
Always use parameterized queries. In Java: PreparedStatement. In Node: parameterized queries.
If you need dynamic table/column names, validate against a whitelist.

**自动校验**：CI check: grep for string concatenation in SQL strings (+ "SELECT" etc) → BLOCK.
SonarQube: SQL injection rules enabled.
npm audit / Maven dependency check: run on every PR.

---

### SEC-002：认证与授权
**人读说明**：所有 API 端点（除公开文档和登录接口外）必须经过认证中间件。
权限检查必须基于角色而非硬编码。

**AI 提示片段**：
Every API endpoint (except /health, /docs, /auth/login) MUST go through auth middleware.
Authorization checks must be role-based, NOT hardcoded user IDs.
NEVER write: if (userId === 'admin') ... — use role/permission system.

**自动校验**：CI check: grep for unprotected routes → WARN.
Auth middleware unit test must pass.

---

## 数据安全

### DATA-001：敏感数据加密
**人读说明**：PII（个人身份信息）、密码、Token 不得明文存储。
日志中不得包含敏感数据。

**AI 提示片段**：
CRITICAL: NEVER log passwords, tokens, API keys, or PII.
Passwords MUST be hashed (bcrypt/argon2). Tokens MUST be encrypted at rest.
Log statements should use placeholder patterns that strip sensitive fields.

**自动校验**：CI check: grep for console.log/System.out with password/token/key → BLOCK.
Security scan: detect plain-text secrets in codebase.

---

### DATA-002：数据库迁移安全
**人读说明**：DROP/TRUNCATE/DELETE 操作必须有二次确认和回滚脚本。

**AI 提示片段**：
NEVER write DROP TABLE or TRUNCATE without explicit approval.
Always include a ROLLBACK script alongside every migration.
DELETE statements MUST verify affected row count.
All migrations run in a transaction by default.

**自动校验**：CI check: grep for DROP TABLE without IF EXISTS in migration files → BLOCK.
Pre-deploy: dry-run migration on staging dump.

---

## API 设计

### API-001：错误响应格式
**人读说明**：所有 API 错误必须返回统一格式：

<pre><code set:html={apiErrorExampleSimple}></pre>

**AI 提示片段**：
All error responses MUST use the standard format:

<pre><code set:html={apiErrorExampleFull}></pre>
HTTP status codes: 400 (validation), 401 (auth), 403 (permission), 404, 409, 422, 500.

**自动校验**：API test: every error endpoint returns the standard format.
OpenAPI/Swagger validation: check response schemas.

---

## 测试要求

### TEST-001：关键路径必测
**人读说明**：核心业务逻辑、支付流程、认证流程的代码覆盖率不低于 80%。

**AI 提示片段**：
When implementing or modifying core business logic, payment flow, or auth flow:
- Write tests FIRST (TDD preferred) or alongside implementation
- Coverage must be >= 80% for these paths
- Include happy path, edge cases, error cases, and security boundary tests

**自动校验**：CI check: coverage report for core paths must show >= 80%.
Test run must pass before merge.

---

*版本：v1*
*每次项目「出错」→ 新增一条规则。每次「规则没用」→ 删掉或简化。*
</code></pre>

  <p>→ 如何使用见 <a href="/handbook/constitution">Constitution 模式</a></p>
